    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but isn't the real issue that NATO is just acting as a tool for US hegemony to contain Russia? it seems like the expansion is less about \"defending\" smaller countries and more about just encircling a rival to keep them weak. don't you think that's the main driver behind all this?",
